    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Enter the Grind</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cashgrab: Refunded</i> is a roguelite multiplayer title in which hustlers get their money up by pillaging The Grind - a sprawling and esoteric corporate structure home to terrible monsters and grabbas alike.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/61cd0c1b9eef7c46fcc3432b73177d1a.poster.avif?t=1750429825\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/61cd0c1b9eef7c46fcc3432b73177d1a.webm?t=1750429825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/61cd0c1b9eef7c46fcc3432b73177d1a.mp4?t=1750429825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Build Your Grabba</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with our revolutionary face upload system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/f5b04523e1d810bbf148f124c98e0814.poster.avif?t=1750429825\" width=308 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/f5b04523e1d810bbf148f124c98e0814.webm?t=1750429825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/f5b04523e1d810bbf148f124c98e0814.mp4?t=1750429825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>#TeamFriends</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything\u2019s better with your buddies. Navigate treacherous terrain and fight back the local horrors together - or die one by one. When all\u2019s said and done, how\u2019ll you split up the cash? Do your best to make sure negotiations don\u2019t go sideways - or make sure you\u2019re the one who comes out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/39f0e6419b39201422f167f3c51a7e47.poster.avif?t=1750429825\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/39f0e6419b39201422f167f3c51a7e47.webm?t=1750429825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602720/extras/39f0e6419b39201422f167f3c51a7e47.mp4?t=1750429825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Spend Money to Make Money</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success isn\u2019t guaranteed. The deeper you go into The Grind the more you stand to gain - and the more likely you are to lose. Use cash to customize your grabba, buy items and ensure you\u2019ve got what you need to get out in the green. As you develop your abilities and your loot pool undertake more daring adventures and watch your money grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Discover the Truth</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Grabba - The Goblins - The Stock Market - how does it all connect? The truth is obscured, for now. Discover the secret and reap the rewards!</p>",
